    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Controls.PgText" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">[WASD], [Space], [Arrow Keys] to move.

With those you can jump, air dive, slide, and swim too.

You can press [Escape] to pause, and in the pause menu you can press [R] to restart.</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Credits.HeaderText" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">Credits</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="float" Name="Credits.Height" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:float">939</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Credits.Parent" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">SectionList.InnerPanelInstance</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Credits.PgText" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">Developed by Jason Sun

Inspired by...
Flood Escape 2 (Roblox)
Flood Escape Ultimate (Roblox)

Map Music from FE2, FE2CM, FEU
Some SFX from Valorant

Thank you for playing.</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Diffs.HeaderText" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">Map Difficulties?</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="float" Name="Diffs.Height" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:float">1775</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Diffs.Parent" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">SectionList.InnerPanelInstance</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Diffs.PgText" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">These are the colored numbers that label each map. 

The first number gives the major difficulty category, second number after the dot is the precise range inside that category.

Minor Ratings (Easy to Hard):
?.0 -&gt; Baseline
?.5 -&gt; Mid
?.9 -&gt; Peak

Difficulties Ratings:
0 - Other
1 - Easy
2 - Medium
3 - Hard
4 - Intense
5 - Crazy
6 - Merciless
7 - Extreme</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Editor.HeaderText" SetsValue="true">
      <Value xsi:type="xsd:string">Map Editor</Value>
    </Variable>
    <Variable Type="string" Name="Editor.Parent" SetsValue="true">
